 Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nMonica and Chandler have been married for the past four years. Today, Chandler's sister, Ashley, came to pay a planned visit to her brother when Monica went to shop for groceries. Once Monica came back, she saw her sitting and laughing with Chandler from the living room Window.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Monica ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Surprise\nB) Disappointment\nC) Excitement\nD) Nervousness\nE) Jealousy\nF) Oblivious\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Monica feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She thinks that Chandler is cheating on her\nB) She sees her husband having a good time with his sister\nC) She doesn't know who the woman is\nD) They are celebrating their fourth anniversary","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0059110700383192,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e2d6006945d280aadb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369762553,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c9ae64ad40dc4cf8aafce8e983e60af3"}